name: sim.getScriptHandle
description: 
luaSynopsis: int scriptHandle=sim.getScriptHandle(int scriptType,string scriptName='',int objectHandle=-1)
pythonSynopsis: int scriptHandle=sim.getScriptHandle(int scriptType,string scriptName='',int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptType: the type of the script, or sim.handle_self
2. scriptName: the name of the add-on. If the script is not an add-on, set this to en empty string.
3. objectHandle: the handle of the object the script is attached to, in case of a child- or customization script
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. handle of the script, or -1 if the script does not exist
